{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27308","headline":"前相国赞皇公早葺平泉山居蹔还憩旋起赴诏命作镇浙右輙抒怀赋四言诗十四首奉寄 十 · 裴潾","name":"前相国赞皇公早葺平泉山居蹔还憩旋起赴诏命作镇浙右輙抒怀赋四言诗十四首奉寄 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寝丘之田，土山之上。\n孙既贻谋，谢亦遐想。\n俭则爲福，华固难长。\n宁若我心，一泉一壤。\n造适爲足，超然孤赏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴潾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}